{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1478714-a-defeated-huntsman-panoply","id":1478714,"title":"A defeated Huntsman panoply.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-12T15:32:36-07:00","id":1478714,"title":"A defeated Huntsman panoply.","content":"So, I am running a changeling game, and I am planning to maybe add a Huntsman with the title &quot;Lord of the Lash&quot;.<br /> Lord of the Lash's panoply is The Iron Whip and The Slavemaster's Banner.<br /> So I am considering that the players might end up freeing the huntsman in question, in this case, would the Huntsman be able to keep her Panoply? As in could it still be used by her even without the title?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27153-lunalupa","name":"LunaLupa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27153_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-12T17:04:29-07:00","id":1478720,"title":"","content":"The panoply is part of the Huntsman's identity; it may be particularly apropos that the Fae who dispatched it used a Title corresponding to its panoply, but it would be &quot;a Huntsman with a whip and a banner&quot; with or without the Title.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-12T18:33:33-07:00","id":1478723,"title":"","content":"Make sense.<br /> I asked because I planned to make her an NPC and was curious about how much power she would keep without the title.<br /> I imagine that the next huntsman with this title will have a similar but different panoply in a way that matches the title granted by the True Fae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27153-lunalupa","name":"LunaLupa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27153_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-18T14:44:09-07:00","id":1479099,"title":"","content":"As a side note, do you think that a Panoply could persist and keep its powers after his owner death?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-19T05:19:10-07:00","id":1479128,"title":"","content":"Looking at Tokens like Auroch's Horn in the core book, I would say that is very probable the panoply would remain after the huntsman death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27153-lunalupa","name":"LunaLupa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27153_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}